  "description": "Use cases and repository patterns for ezDDD.NET - Clean Architecture support with event sourcing and state sourcing.\n\nFeatures:\n• IUseCase<TInput, TOutput> - Command pattern interface\n• IRepository/IRepositoryPeer - Bridge pattern for persistence abstraction\n• EsRepository - Generic event sourcing repository with reflection optimization\n• OutboxRepository - State sourcing with Transactional Outbox pattern\n• IReactor/IExternalDomainEventPublisher - Event reaction and external publishing ports\n• DomainEventMapper - Event serialization/deserialization\n• Transaction boundary enforcement\n• Async/await throughout\n\nImplements Clean Architecture layers with tactical DDD patterns.",
